DESCRIPTION:International Men's Day falls on November 19 and is marked most
 ly by men's health organizations\, fatherhood charities and\, in some year
 s\, by national parliaments. It was founded in 1999 by Dr Jerome Teelucksi
 ngh\, a history lecturer at the University of the West Indies in Trinidad 
 and Tobago. It carries no official status: it is not a United Nations obse
 rvance\, and the day's own coordinating body still lists formal recognitio
 n on the UN calendar among its goals for 2026.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.
 com/holiday/international-mens-day/
